   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,153:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: control plane (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: firewallctl
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ).
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,161:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 📋 Architectural Overview (The 16 Steps)
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,376:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,378:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Single Linux Host
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Runs host routing, Incus container lab, and the eBPF kernel dataplane.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,383:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,385:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Incus Containers
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,386:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Lightweight containers (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,388:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,390:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,391:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: attacker
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,393:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: webserver
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,396:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,397:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: admin
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,400:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) acting as
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,402:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: independent network hosts.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,403:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,405:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Three Network Segments
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,407:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Untrusted (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,409:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10.10.1.0/24
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,410:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ), Protected (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,412:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10.10.2.0/24
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,414:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ), and
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,416:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Management (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,418:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10.10.99.0/24
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ).
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,421:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,423:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Host Routing
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Joined via host bridges (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,427:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: incus-untrust
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,429:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,431:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: incus-protect
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,434:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) and routed by the
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,436:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: host kernel.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,438:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,441:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: XDP Ingress Hook
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,444:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Early packet filtering before SKB allocation in the Linux network driver.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  6 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,449:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: eBPF Logic Pipeline
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 4-stage processing: Parser → State Engine → Rule Matcher → Telemetry.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  7 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,479:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5-Tuple Packet Parsing
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,482:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Extracts source/dest IP, source/dest port, protocol, and TCP flags.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,484:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  8 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,486:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Dynamic eBPF Rule Table
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Policy rules stored in 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: rules_map
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,492:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  array for zero-recompile runtime
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,494:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: updates.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,496:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  9 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Stateful Connection Tracking
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,500:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Full TCP handshake and flow lifecycle management in 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,502:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: conntrack_map
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,504:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,506:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  10 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,508:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Userspace Control Tool (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,510:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: firewallctl
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,512:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Dynamic policy management, conntrack inspection,
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,518:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: and telemetry.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  11 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,523:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Granular Statistics
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,528:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Per-CPU line-rate counters for packets, drops, and flow states in 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,532:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stats_map
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,536:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,540:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  12 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,543:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Baseline Comparison
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,546:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Standardized comparison against kernel 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,550:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: nftables
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,552:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,554:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  13 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,556:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Traffic Generation
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,558:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,561:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: iperf3
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,563:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  throughput, 
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,565:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ping
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:08:59,568:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  latency, and 
