   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,255:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |                 |  XDP Ingress Hook (Step 5) |                   
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,256:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,271:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |                 +--------------+-------------+                   
