   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,307:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,321:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |         +---------------------------------------------+          
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,322:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
