   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,338:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,362:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |         |   1. 5-Tuple Packet Parser (Step 7)         |          
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,364:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,382:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |         |   2. Stateful Connection Engine (Step 9)    |          
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,400:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |         |   3. Dynamic Rule Matcher (Step 8)          |          
