   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,496:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |                 |                             |                  
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:            |                     |
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |           [ XDP_DROP ]                  [ XDP_PASS ]             
