   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,925:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,926:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: firewallctl conntrack list / flush
