   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,929:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: firewallctl stats show / reset
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,930:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,931:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: firewallctl monitor
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,933:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Step 11: Collect granular statistics
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,934:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,935:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stats_map
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,936:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,938:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_ARRAY
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,939:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) maintains line-rate per-CPU counters:
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,941:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,942:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Total packets received, allowed, and dropped.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,943:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,945:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Breakdown by protocol: TCP, UDP, ICMP, Other.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,947:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,949:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Drop classifications: policy drop, unsolicited/out-of-state drop, malformed drop.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,950:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,952:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Stateful connection lifecycle: new, established, closed, timed out.
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,954:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Step 12: Build a baseline for comparison (nftables vs. XDP)
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,956:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
