   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,965:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,966:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-09-04 00:09:01,969:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Measures throughput (iperf3), latency (ping RTT), and CPU utilization under SYN floods.
